号池故障分类移植来源与许可说明

account_pool_failover.py contains a Python adaptation of error classification and
bounded retry decisions from Wei-Shaw/sub2api
Source: https://github.com/Wei-Shaw/sub2api
Revision: 698d142468ab15374bc22bd5247759e5b7352006
Original work: sub2api contributors, copyright retained by the original authors
Adaptation date: 2026-10-15
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later, without warranty

The original Go implementation was adapted into pure Python classifications,
with LiteLLM error envelopes and CLIProxyAPI unavailable-model compatibility
The adapter does not copy the Go scheduler, database, authentication, or server
The Python adapter source is distributed in the same package and can be replaced
or modified without modifying the surrounding application

The complete LGPL v3 and incorporated GPL v3 are provided in the adjacent
account_pool_failover.LICENSE and account_pool_failover.GPL-3.0 files
The remaining LiteLLM code retains its existing license
See account-pool/docs/sub2api-port.md in the repository for behavior differences
